    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31229" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰρων-εύομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>feign ignorance</i>, so as to perplex, <i><span class="en">
